  "plan": "First, inspect the file: list it, check its type, and run it to observe behavior. Then decompile it (file, strings, objdump/disassembly). I'll emit progress markers as I go. Let me start by exploring.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cd /app && ls -la\n",
      "duration": 0.1
